"""Shared fixtures and helpers for the hair editor tests.

Most of the hair editor only makes sense with an asset from the hair editor asset pack, which is not part
of the repository. Tests that need one use the hair_character / fur_character fixtures, which skip when
the pack (or the asset) is not installed. Everything else builds its own small scene out of plain meshes
and hand made hair curves, so it runs anywhere.
"""

